A field the new version removes from a struct the lens writes: it is
reported at that struct, and the drop the help offers goes inside it.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		note:  string
	}
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}

ForwardLens: (prev): {
	self: {
		meta: {
			owner: prev.meta.owner
		}
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0347]: v0.0 declares meta.note and v1.0 does not, and nothing maps it
  --> history/1.0.thema:10:3
   |
10 |         meta: {
   |         ^^^^
   |
   = help: write <field>: prev.meta.note to move it, or add note: _drop to self.meta
